# Routes that used to exist. Cloudflare Pages keeps serving a deleted page from
# an earlier deployment, and the old /guides/ index still links to /youtubers/,
# which is gone — so both need to land somewhere real rather than 404 or, worse,
# render a stale page with dead navigation.
#
# Exact paths only: /guides/<slug>/ write-ups are still live and must not match —
# /books/ is now their index, which is where the old index URL should land.
/guides      /books/   301
/guides/     /books/   301
/youtubers   /videos/  301
/youtubers/  /videos/  301
